FerrumTorrens
https://github.com/butzist/ferrum-torrens

This project is an independent, torch-less Rust reimplementation inspired by
FreeToken. The Triton kernel sources under python/ferrum_kernel/ are ports and
derivatives of FreeToken's kernel sources (python/freetoken/kernel/triton/).

